ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Muchas gracias por lo mucho que
me has ayudado,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡La {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} que me diste no me
podría haber venido mejor!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}No pierdas de vista el buzón,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}que te he enviado un detallito
a modo de agradecimiento,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ji,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ji.{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merci beaucoup pour le {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}remède{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
miracle que tu m'as donné,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}} !
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}C'est uniquement grâce à toi si j'ai
à nouveau bon pied, bon œil !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Je vais t'envoyer un petit cadeau
pour te remercier !{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Geçenlerde bana yardım ettiğin
için çok teşekkür ederim,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}} Verdiğin
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ilaç{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} gerçekten işe yaradı!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Ne kadar minnettar olduğumu göstermek istedim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}bu yüzden yakında postayla küçük
bir hediye yolluyorum!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
